<title>UK: ABN Amro adds 100 mln guilders to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro adds 100 mln guilders to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond self led by ABN AMRO has been increased by 100 million guilders.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABN AMRO NV</p>
<p> AMT   *600 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    29.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.99    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.39     SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    *LAUNCHED EARLIER FOR 500 MILLION GUILDERS.</p>
<p>	    SUBORDINATED ISSUE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
